    {
      "id": "save-persistence-boundary",
      "text": "Keep Save as persistence boundary\nCurrent: implemented. Draft edits do not auto-save. Explicit Save/commit writes the live draft to the managed resource; Reload/discard returns saved state and drops the live draft.\nExisting saved patch remains the durable disk-write path for saved-resource APIs.",
      "tags": [
        "implementation",
        "implemented",
        "storage",
        "verified"
      ],
      "layout": {
        "position": {
          "x": 1275.270124996784,
          "y": 1085.721665085257
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "selection-as-brief",
      "text": "Selection as implementation brief — implemented\nWhen user selects graph nodes and asks AI to implement/fix, selected nodes become scoped task intent. AI is told to inspect the actual program before editing and not confuse graph nodes with source code.",
      "tags": [
        "ai",
        "core",
        "implemented",
        "intent"
      ],
      "layout": {
        "position": {
          "x": 82.71325468800205,
          "y": 363.05161380370816
