      "id": "shift-lasso-stuck",
      "text": "UI bug fixed: shift-select lasso cleanup\nAdded a React Flow store cleanup on window pointerup, pointercancel, and blur so the blue selection rectangle clears after shift-drag release while preserving selected nodes.",
