    {
      "id": "tool-routing-live-first",
      "text": "Change graph tools to live-first\nCurrent: implemented. Graph edit tools mutate the live draft by default; saved state is fallback when no live draft exists. Tool/list/query/context outputs expose source metadata where applicable.\nReload now explicitly reloads saved state and discards live draft for that resource.",
      "tags": [
        "ai",
